                                                "sense_id": "cbfd0cc2-00ed-3c93-b5ca-62c19e3ab375",
                                                "text": "The patrol cop with the radiotelephone remained outside the bar, as the rest of the cops entered the club shouting: \"Police! We're taking the place!\""
